** Vocab Breakdown**
Contemporary Art- Contemporary Art has no fixed style or apperance becasue like the world its ever evolving. It gives a lot of room for expression and it allows the artist to speak on real world 
Cubism- Cubism the way I see it is taking something breaking it apart and creating a million different perspectives to it. Since there are so many perspectives to Cubism art there never is just one linear storyline or otlook; its very creative in that sense.
Directional Lines- Its pretty self explanitory. Directional lines help direct the viewers eyes to a specific part of a piece. 
Value Contrast- The difference between light and darkness in a piece of art. 
Focal Point- Where you want the viewers eyes to shoot to. Where you would want the main message of your piece to go. 
** AI PRompt** Create a promotional landing page for an exhibition titled Gods of Symmetry. Make the subject matter Greek Art; the landing page should show works with perfect symmetry and the ideas of divine mythology expressed through statues of marble. Playing with the ideas of perfect symmetry; in contrast use the style of Cubism whos abstract characteristcs will contrast traditional Greek Ideals of perfection and order. The layout must have a clear contrast as the vibrantly colored shapes of Cubism crash agasint the polished smooth marble of the statues. Use straight contour  for the statues to help guide the viewers eyes, and use irregular lines to create movement. Make up text about the exhibitions time and date. 
